cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Camera-Observable MAPPO for Traffic Signal Control"
abstract: >-
  A decentralized multi-agent reinforcement learning (MAPPO) controller for
  traffic signal control whose entire observation and reward are computable from
  a single roadside camera (YOLO detections + ByteTrack trajectories), trained
  and evaluated in SUMO under motorcycle-dominant mixed traffic.
